      "instance_name": "aggressive_protest_scene",
      "label": "Protest with aggressive confrontation",
      "description": "A scene depicting a protest where a central man in the foreground is shouting aggressively and pointing forward, while other men in the background raise their fists and hold flags, indicating collective action or demonstration. The visual composition emphasizes the central figure's anger and the group's unified, confrontational stance.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
